# Keep Docker build contexts small and deterministic.
#
# Included (implicitly, by omission from this file):
#   src-rust/        — Rust workspace, needed by deploy/simon/Dockerfile
#   deploy/          — build contexts for all service Dockerfiles
#   demo/corpus/     — bind-mounted into corpus-init at runtime
#   scripts/         — corpus prep helpers referenced by demo/
#   README.md        — shipped at repo root, referenced by runtime
#
# Excluded: everything below.

# Build artefacts
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk
**/Cargo.lock.tmp
**/.cargo/
**/node_modules/

# VCS / CI
.git/
.github/
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# Editor / IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Devcontainer (separate from docker-compose flow)
.devcontainer/

# Docs and site — none of this is needed inside any image
docs/
public/
index.html
CNAME
plan.md
spec/

# Stray markdown files at repo root, except the main README
*.md
!README.md
!deploy/**/*.md
!docs/simon/**/*.md

# Local env / secrets
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.crt

# Test outputs
**/coverage/
**/*.log
